   :criterion
   "Resolve a declared foreign symbol and dynamically load an admitted library/module only under package/deployment policy, the named provider/library/version identity and required effects/grants. Emit the binding, symbol-resolution and generated-adapter records tied to target ABI, calling convention, layout/alignment and source/unsafe audit. Positive fixtures resolve the admitted identity through its safe wrapper/provider; negative fixtures reject wrong/missing symbols, mismatched ABI/layout/provider identity and ungranted or policy-denied dynamic loading. Resolution/loading does not bypass nullability, lifetime/ownership, callback affinity/taint or foreign error conversion contracts. Preserve the delivered split between resolution and loading as two criteria within this same task, without accepting an alias or retiring their history.",
